# F2 > About (2026-11-17): the last icon of the rail, reached with Q (L1) from Display, wrapping. The run's
# launcher stand-in gives the game PS3_UPDATE_DIR (a status.txt with the version; supporters.json is put there
# and changed while the game runs: the page follows within 3 s) and PS3_SUPPORTERS_FILE (the shipped copy).
#   shipped copy only -> a fetched list -> a hostile file (control characters, %s %n, 600 names, an http link)
# Enter on "Project page" opens the browser. Keys are posted to the window; shots are the game's own image.
# Run: tools\fast.ps1 -Tag about1 -Steps tools\menu_about.steps -NoPictureCheck -Extra "PS3_UPDATE_DIR=...;PS3_SUPPORTERS_FILE=..."
#! seconds 300
#! savefrom work\saves\first-save\gamedata
#! fastmovies 1
